      en: ["The Massif des Bauges Regional Natural Park was established in 1995.", "Awarded the UNESCO Global Geopark status in 2011.", "The highest peak in the massif is Arcalod, at 2,217 meters.", "The park covers an expansive area of over 90,000 hectares.", "Origin of the Tome des Bauges cheese, which holds AOC protection.", "Home to a significant population of around 1,500 chamois."],
